an activity, a duration and a null string

NSUserActivity and NSDateComponentsFormatter were forwarding stubs, so an initialiser answered
nil and a formatter answered nil, and the application that used those results crashed rather
than degraded: first a message to a leftover register value, then CFStringCreateCopy on a null
string, called from CFAttributedStringCreate.

Neither needs a real implementation to be safe, only an honest one. The activity holds the
values it is given, because nothing here hands an activity to another device. The formatter
renders the components it is given in the plain 1h 2m 3s shape; it does not consult
allowedUnits, and what it guarantees is a string.

--- a/include/Foundation/NSUserActivity.h
+++ b/include/Foundation/NSUserActivity.h
@@ -23,5 +23,38 @@
 // Nothing here continues an activity, but the name is bound before main.
 FOUNDATION_EXPORT NSString * const NSUserActivityDocumentURLKey;
 
-@interface NSUserActivity : NSObject
+/*
+ * A HANDOFF ACTIVITY THAT IS NEVER HANDED OFF, and therefore just an object that holds its values.
+ *
+ * It was a forwarding stub, so -initWithActivityType: answered nil, and an application that copied a
+ * string off the result crashed inside CFStringCreateCopy on null. Holding the values costs nothing
+ * and every getter answers what was set.
+ */
+@interface NSUserActivity : NSObject {
+    NSString *_activityType;
+    NSString *_title;
+    NSDictionary *_userInfo;
+    NSURL *_webpageURL;
+    BOOL _eligibleForHandoff;
+    BOOL _eligibleForSearch;
+    BOOL _eligibleForPublicIndexing;
+    BOOL _needsSave;
+    BOOL _valid;
+}
+
+- (instancetype) initWithActivityType: (NSString *) activityType;
+
+@property (readonly, copy) NSString *activityType;
+@property (copy) NSString *title;
+@property (copy) NSDictionary *userInfo;
+@property (copy) NSURL *webpageURL;
+@property (getter=isEligibleForHandoff) BOOL eligibleForHandoff;
+@property (getter=isEligibleForSearch) BOOL eligibleForSearch;
+@property (getter=isEligibleForPublicIndexing) BOOL eligibleForPublicIndexing;
+@property BOOL needsSave;
+
+- (void) becomeCurrent;
+- (void) resignCurrent;
+- (void) invalidate;
+
 @end
--- a/src/NSUserActivity.m
+++ b/src/NSUserActivity.m
